WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.503
Please welcome, the one,
we hope the only, Triple H.

00:00:04.413 --> 00:00:07.913
(rock music and cheering)

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:29.173
That was some good acting on your part.

00:00:29.173 --> 00:00:30.570
You got a hell of a grip, man.

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:31.403
Yes, I do.

00:00:31.403 --> 00:00:32.485
I'm quite a man.

00:00:32.485 --> 00:00:34.590
(audience laughter)

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:35.710
Now let's talk here.

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:40.520
You are probably the best
bad guy in the world.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:41.760
You're very good at it.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:42.920
You enjoy it, don't you?

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:44.130
You enjoy being the bad guy.

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:45.973
Yeah, that's what I, it's what I live for.

00:00:45.973 --> 00:00:47.880
When the people are booing

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.060
or they're screaming and spitting at me,

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:50.930
that's what I live for.

00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:53.450
I mean, it's the, it sounds weird,

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:54.760
but it's the best part of my job.

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:56.610
And the funny thing about our industry

00:00:56.610 --> 00:01:00.070
is that most times the baddest bad guys

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:01.210
tend to be the nicest guys

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:02.400
personally.
Backstage, right.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:04.290
Yeah, you know, and the good guys

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:06.030
tend to be the biggest jerks, you know?

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:07.783
I mean, pretty much like you.

00:01:09.216 --> 00:01:13.160
(audience cheers and boos)

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:15.130
that's the best you've got?

00:01:16.265 --> 00:01:17.098
That's it?

00:01:17.098 --> 00:01:18.048
(laughing)

00:01:18.048 --> 00:01:19.570
I'm serious, I met him backstage.

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:21.620
He comes off as a great
guy out here, right?

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:23.522
He's all smiling, happy, making you laugh.

00:01:23.522 --> 00:01:25.990
Backstage, what a jerk.

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:28.330
(audience laughs and boos)

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:29.743
you are the biggest, the
biggest Hollywood piece of crap

00:01:29.743 --> 00:01:30.717
I ever met!

00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:32.200
That's all you've got?

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:33.678
You can't do better than that?

00:01:33.678 --> 00:01:36.928
(audience boos louder)

00:01:40.152 --> 00:01:40.985
They don't understand.

00:01:40.985 --> 00:01:41.818
They don't under,

00:01:41.818 --> 00:01:42.651
They don't understand.

00:01:42.651 --> 00:01:45.930
They don't understand that
the booing makes you stronger.

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:48.344
It makes me strong like bull.

00:01:48.344 --> 00:01:50.174
(all laugh)

00:01:50.174 --> 00:01:51.400
But I am a big jerk backstage.

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:52.623
It's what I enjoy doing.

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:56.804
Do people, by the way, you're a fat head.

00:01:56.804 --> 00:02:00.554
(audience laughs and cheers)

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:07.830
Is this your attempt to
doing what I do for a living?

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:08.947
Inciting people?

00:02:08.947 --> 00:02:11.780
I think if I started
being like a real bad guy,

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:13.300
I think it would be, I mean, our show,

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:15.090
our ratings couldn't
probably get any higher

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:15.990
than they are now.

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:18.760
But I think if I started, I changed

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:21.680
my whole persona and went
after people just like you.

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:23.995
I think that the show
would just really take off.

00:02:23.995 --> 00:02:24.828
And if--

00:02:24.828 --> 00:02:26.700
So if you had an attitude, a bad attitude,

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:27.791
you think that would help?

00:02:27.791 --> 00:02:28.624
That's right, jerk!

00:02:28.624 --> 00:02:30.443
(audience laughs)

00:02:30.443 --> 00:02:31.276
Look at my long hair.

00:02:31.276 --> 00:02:33.860
I mean, come on, you look
like a Fabio on crack.

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:35.227
I mean, you know,

00:02:35.227 --> 00:02:37.425
(speech drowned out by audience)

00:02:37.425 --> 00:02:39.008
Seriously!

00:02:39.008 --> 00:02:43.329
You got the big man boobies
up here, look at that.

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:44.162
(screams)

00:02:44.162 --> 00:02:45.253
No, no, no!

00:02:45.253 --> 00:02:46.086
No, no!

00:02:47.097 --> 00:02:48.803
(laughs)

00:02:48.803 --> 00:02:50.360
Sit.

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:52.860
Just kidding, (laughs)

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.143
Oh great, I wet myself.

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:57.960
You forgot the, you forgot the first rule

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:00.620
of being a bad guy is you can talk trash

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:01.502
but you have to

00:03:01.502 --> 00:03:02.385
be able to back it up.
You gotta back it up

00:03:02.385 --> 00:03:03.960
Yeah, I don't have the backing up thing.

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:04.990
If I took my jacket off,

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:06.790
my torso would fall onto the ground.

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.133
It's the only thing holding
me together right now,

00:03:10.133 --> 00:03:11.780
You're like the coat hanger
with meat and hanging off it.

00:03:11.780 --> 00:03:14.967
(all laugh)

00:03:14.967 --> 00:03:18.070
Now you're sort of like
Shecky Greene, yeah.

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:19.490
You're Don Rickles, yeah.

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:23.290
Now people actually carry signs
at these wrestling matches.

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:26.640
They carry signs that say
how much they hate you.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:28.643
Is there, and you have to look--

00:03:28.643 --> 00:03:29.603
(yells from audience)

00:03:29.603 --> 00:03:30.436
Shut up!

00:03:30.436 --> 00:03:31.930
You have to look at that.

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:32.763
Good comeback.

00:03:32.763 --> 00:03:35.330
Yeah, you have to, you have
to look at these signs,

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:37.497
which I think would be
really difficult to see.

00:03:37.497 --> 00:03:39.993
What sign has particularly
stuck out lately?

00:03:41.535 --> 00:03:42.620
I mean, we get all kinds of signs.

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:44.700
I mean, from, you know, people hating us.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.799
A lot of them are the same,
sometimes there's original ones.

00:03:46.799 --> 00:03:49.680
Actually my favorite sign,
'cause I'm a big fan of the show,

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:51.080
believe it or not.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.740
My favorite sign was
just a little bit ago.

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:53.880
There was a sign in the crowd.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.890
And one of the sayings
that I say all the time

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:57.350
is that I'm that damn good.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:58.940
[Conan] Right, right.

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:02.610
And it was a sign that said
"Triple H is that damn good?"

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:03.930
And when the guy flipped the sign over,

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.701
it said, "for me to poop on."

00:04:05.701 --> 00:04:08.534
(audience cheers)

00:04:11.071 --> 00:04:12.290
and I really thought that was great.

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:14.440
I'm a big Triumph fan, you know?

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:18.320
I like the image of you
being happy for a second.

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.190
And then ah!

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:22.740
Did, do you ever smile,

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:24.660
because in all the
footage I've seen of you,

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:25.770
you are never smiling.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:27.770
Have you ever smiled once in the ring

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:28.670
that you can remember?

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:29.503
One time.

00:04:29.503 --> 00:04:30.533
[Conan] Yeah.

00:04:30.533 --> 00:04:33.130
About a year ago, maybe a
little bit less than that.

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:36.320
We, there's a wrestler that
wrestles for us named Al Snow.

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:40.290
And I was wrestling Al Snow
in a match on, on television.

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:43.675
And I picked him up for a suplex and--

00:04:43.675 --> 00:04:44.520
[Conan] What's the suplex?

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:46.005
Basically a move where
I hold a guy straight up

00:04:46.005 --> 00:04:47.270
in the air, his head's here,

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:48.330
his legs are straight up in the air.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:50.650
I let the blood rush to his
head for about 10, 15 seconds

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:51.660
and then drop them backwards.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:52.920
Yeah, I do that sometimes

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:55.150
if I have a little sticky situation.

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:56.450
Yeah.

00:04:56.450 --> 00:05:00.250
So I grabbed him by his trunks
and as I went to pick him up,

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:02.010
I held him up for about
five or six seconds

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:04.360
and I heard the crowd start to laugh.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:05.977
And I was kind of confused for a second.

00:05:05.977 --> 00:05:07.650
The referee came around the front side,

00:05:07.650 --> 00:05:08.820
looked up and went, "oh God!"

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.690
and started to laugh.

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:14.100
And I looked up and
realized that his trunks

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:17.280
had slid all the way over to this side.

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:19.600
And he had nothing on
underneath his trunks.

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:21.015
Right, right.

00:05:21.015 --> 00:05:23.540
And the hard part is,
people are laughing, which--

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:24.800
Yeah.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:27.270
Which I can attest, this is
not a pleasant situation.

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:28.210
They should've been.

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:29.450
It looked like a grub worm

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:30.460
was trying to borrow out of a fur coat.

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:31.553
All right!

00:05:32.767 --> 00:05:36.280
(audience applauds)

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:37.210
Wow.

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:38.060
Yeah, it was--

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:40.010
You're like James Joyce with these images.

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:43.380
These are beautiful,
wonderful images here.

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:44.870
So anyways, I ended up, you know,

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:46.540
just, the crowd was laughing.

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:47.373
I was laughing.

00:05:47.373 --> 00:05:48.820
I gave him the suplex and on the way down,

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.630
I just said, (indistinct), you know.

00:05:52.242 --> 00:05:53.787
(audience cheers)

00:05:53.787 --> 00:05:54.620
And uh.

00:05:56.569 --> 00:05:58.531
(audience continues cheering)

00:05:58.531 --> 00:05:59.364
it was.

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:03.395
You could have used another word.

00:06:03.395 --> 00:06:05.563
Could have said your grub worm is showing.

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:10.380
But no, that's not your style.

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:12.570
You sell, you, you're actually,

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:13.810
a lot of, a lot of stuff.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:16.840
A lot of, a lot of Triple
H souvenirs are selling

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:18.650
for a lot of money on eBay.

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:19.551
Is this true?

00:06:19.551 --> 00:06:20.384
Yeah.

00:06:20.384 --> 00:06:22.070
We actually, WWF has
their own auction site.

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:23.330
And we do, you know,

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:24.960
