fans, our fans are crazy.

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:30.588
They're kind of like Trekkies,
but not nerds, you know?

00:06:30.588 --> 00:06:32.044
And, and they'll buy.

00:06:32.044 --> 00:06:33.723
