do some serious damage.

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:38.203
Yeah.

00:06:38.203 --> 00:06:40.120
If you, if you, if you get in their face.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.440
Yeah, but they'll buy just about anything,

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:45.630
