00:06:52.431 --> 00:06:53.560
And people, they don't, they
don't clean the blood off?

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:54.588
They keep the blood on?

00:06:54.588 --> 00:06:56.450
No, that's the, that's the thrill.

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:58.200
Blood actually makes it worth more.

00:06:59.161 --> 00:06:59.994
My blood sells for a lot.
Have you ever like,

00:06:59.994 --> 00:07:00.827
if you're hard up,

00:07:00.827 --> 00:07:02.387
would you just ever like, get
like 10 chairs ahead of you

00:07:02.387 --> 00:07:04.387
