00:07:05.237 --> 00:07:06.070
Like jab myself in the head?

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:08.678
And try to get a couple of bucks, yeah.

00:07:08.678 --> 00:07:09.860
(all laugh)

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.310
You always have that to fall back on.

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:12.410
You know what's really weird is that

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:13.790
I'm just, you can't help but notice,

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:16.258
