00:07:16.258 --> 00:07:18.705
It's, and no, actually it's not.

00:07:18.705 --> 00:07:20.760
(all laugh)

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:23.000
This is my leg right here.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.360
That part is my leg.

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:26.774
That's the only thing I
recognize on you as my anatomy.

00:07:26.774 --> 00:07:27.763
Is that more like your torso?

00:07:27.763 --> 00:07:28.596
What is it?

00:07:28.596 --> 00:07:29.770
Can you get implants that do that?

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:30.910
I would just, oh, look at that.

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:33.530
There's like a, it's
like there's a little,

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:35.330
it's like there's a person in there.

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:39.493
It's like you have a, you
hire a dwarf to push up.

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:42.923
No?

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:46.783
Easy.

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:51.510
I am some whoop ass you
do not want to open.

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:54.383
That's what you don't wanna mess with me.

00:07:54.383 --> 00:07:55.983
Seriously, seriously, you don't!

00:07:57.435 --> 00:07:58.333
I think you know, because--

00:07:58.333 --> 00:07:59.166
I can only imagine.

00:07:59.166 --> 00:08:01.150
Because people don't
know this, people on TV.

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:04.840
I play this guy, (whimpers)

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:06.040
got my little tie and stuff.

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:07.410
But when, I don't even take my clothes off

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:09.300
when the show's over, I
flex, and they fly off.

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:11.070
[Triple H] You just shred them.

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:12.370
I walk out when a show's
over and I go ugh,

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:13.220
like that, woosh!

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:15.610
And I'm completely naked.

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:16.890
And I walk the halls.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.540
That is a talent to have.

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:19.900
Yeah, well.

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:21.270
I've never been so full of crap

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.360
as I am tonight on this show.

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:25.690
Now, one thing I wanted to
ask you, is you're very,

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:29.760
very good at just sort of generating

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:33.380
