and that mean look out there.

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:36.369
Do you ever after a really,
really tough match is over,

00:08:36.369 --> 00:08:38.750
do you ever go back, you know,

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:39.930
back into the dressing room

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:41.290
and actually hang out with the guy

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:43.610
that you've been beating
on for the last 20 minutes?

00:08:43.610 --> 00:08:44.443
Half hour?

00:08:44.443 --> 00:08:45.770
Yeah, I mean, sometimes, you know,

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:48.510
I mean, what we do, you
know, guys get along,

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:50.190
some guys don't get
along and, and you know,

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:53.290
there's a, it's kind of the
honor among thieves thing.

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:54.550
We'll kind of hang around afterwards

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.530
