00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:01.490
I'm sure you do it in the back, yeah.

00:09:01.490 --> 00:09:02.323
Oh yeah, I go back there.

00:09:02.323 --> 00:09:03.420
Leno's back there.

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:04.253
Ah, you're pretty good tonight.

00:09:04.253 --> 00:09:05.086
Yeah, I was good.

00:09:07.583 --> 00:09:09.690
Your chin looked great!

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:12.853
But there was actually,
just a little while ago,

00:09:12.853 --> 00:09:17.080
a funny story is I was
at Madison Square Garden.

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:19.710
We had a pay per view there
called the Royal Rumble

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:21.230
and I fought Mick Foley.

00:09:21.230 --> 00:09:22.063
[Conan] Right.

00:09:22.063 --> 00:09:23.990
Actually, Cactus Jack,
he's been on here before.

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:24.840
[Conan] Yes, he's been here.

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:28.700
And it was a particularly violent match.

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:30.330
It was a street fight, my--

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:32.130
You guys are like hitting
each other with chains,

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:32.963
chairs, barbed wire.

00:09:32.963 --> 00:09:33.830
We went at it with everything.

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:36.235
We had a two by fours
covered in barbed wire.

00:09:36.235 --> 00:09:39.487
There were 20,000 thumbtacks in the ring.

00:09:39.487 --> 00:09:40.550
I mean, we did--

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:41.799
What a wonderful sport.

00:09:41.799 --> 00:09:43.120
Yeah.

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:45.061
I got a hole punctured in my leg.

00:09:45.061 --> 00:09:47.820
And, so anyways, after the match is over,

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.690
I've got stitches in my
leg, stitches in my head.

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:52.810
I've got, I look like a spirit
of 76, like the drum player,

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:54.382
the big bandage around my head.

00:09:54.382 --> 00:09:56.790
Mick Foley's back there, same thing.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:58.970
He's all bandaged up, and
Vince McMahon's back there.

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:00.830
And we're all standing
around laughing and talking.

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:03.170
And I look over and there's my mother

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:05.400
bawling her eyes out in the doorway

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:09.279
because she just watched her
baby son get torn apart on,

00:10:09.279 --> 00:10:12.257
right in front of her eyes,
about three rows back, you know.

00:10:12.257 --> 00:10:13.090
(audience aww's)

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:15.083
Wait no, that, that saps
him of his strength.

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:18.620
Sympathy will take away
his power, only booing.

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:22.253
So as a true heal, I just
yelled at her and then--

00:10:22.253 --> 00:10:23.309
[Conan] Yeah, boo, yeah.

00:10:23.309 --> 00:10:24.609
Kicked her and we were out of there.

00:10:24.609 --> 00:10:28.002
(all laughing)

00:10:28.002 --> 00:10:29.310
Yeah, hey, I like,

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:31.440
I like how you thought
people were gonna boo you

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:34.063
kicking your mom, but our
crowd's like, aww (applauds).

00:10:35.827 --> 00:10:36.994
You know it.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:39.360
Yeah, that is a New York crowd.

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:42.580
Well, the Summer Slam is on August 27th

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.810
on pay per view and Triple H,
very nice to have you here.

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:47.210
Nice, thank you very much.

